      "source": "\u003Cdiv align=\u0022center\u0022\u003E\n\n\u003Cimg src=\u0022https://www.python.org/static/community_logos/python-logo-generic.svg\u0022 alt=\u0022Python Logo\u0022 width=\u0022300\u0022/\u003E\n\n# Python Learning Book\n\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\n\u003Chr style=\u0022height:4px; border:none; background: linear-gradient(to right, #3776AB 50%, #FFD43B 50%);\u0022\u003E"
